         <description><![CDATA[<img src='https://i.cbc.ca/ais/1.5700013,1598479458000/full/max/0/default.jpg?im=Crop%2Crect%3D%280%2C63%2C607%2C341%29%3B' alt='' width='620' height='349' title='Regis Korchinski-Paquet died at age 29 after police were called to her apartment in Toronto.'/><p>Regis Korchinski-Paquet's mother questioned the purpose of a coroner's inquest examining the circumstances of her daughter's death as well as the video and audio evidence presented in it, as lawyers for several police officers pressed her Tuesday to clarify what she saw that day.</p>]]></description>
